    Document OpenSearch plugin requirements (#6415)
    
    This documentation patch moves the plugin and configuration requirements
    of OpenSearch into the central OpenSearch guide instead of scattering
    the information across multiple guides. They all link the main guide for
    configuration anyway.
    
    This also switches from documenting Elasticsearch to documenting
    OpenSearch in a few places since that is what we suggest to use after
    all.
    
    This is a backport of 63f91ae (#6312) to `r/17.x` where it should have
    been merged in the first place.
    
